            <div xml:id="d265">

                <pb facs="0280" n="271" xml:id="pg271"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">715.1715/1371: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Assistant to the Special Representative of the
                        President</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Ocheltree</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">San
                                José</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-12-07T10:00:00-06:00">December 7, 1938—10
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received 1:12 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>97. Referring to my telegram No. 96, November 24, 10 a.m. the Nicaraguan
                    Government has notified the Secretariat of the Mediation Commission of its
                    acceptance of the proposal for an aerial survey of the region of the Segovia
                    River.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ocheltree</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
